# Must be **/uploads, not a bare 'uploads'. A bare pattern only matches a
# top-level directory, and the real path is src/uploads/chat-files - so dev
# chat attachments (including multi-MB videos) were being COPY'd into the
# image by 'COPY src ./src' and seeding the named volume on first run.
**/uploads
